@API_Gateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5034

### Gateway Health Check
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Gateway Ready Check
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/ready
Accept: application/json

###

### Gateway Info
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### Login via Gateway (v1)
POST {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@authsystem.local",
  "password": "Admin@123!",
  "applicationCode": "AUTH_SYSTEM"
}

###

### Refresh Token via Gateway (v1)
POST {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "your-refresh-token-here"
}

###

### Logout via Gateway (v1)
POST {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

{
  "refreshToken": "your-refresh-token-here"
}

###

### Get Current User (v1)
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

###

### OIDC Discovery via Gateway
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/.well-known/openid-configuration
Accept: application/json

###

### JWKS via Gateway
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/.well-known/jwks.json
Accept: application/json

###
